10
00:00:40,816 --> 00:00:45,880
[SPEAKER_05]: Those submitting must include the following information, your first and last name, your Memphis street address, your question or comment.

11
00:00:47,155 --> 00:01:05,087
[SPEAKER_05]: The agenda will be as follows, presentation regarding the fiscal year 23 Medford public school operating budget focusing on strategic priorities concerning equitable supports for high needs, most vulnerable students, instructional technology, COVID-19 recovery, and organizational structure.

12
00:01:05,808 --> 00:01:12,993
[SPEAKER_05]: Assistant superintendent of finance and operations, Mr. David Murphy, and we also have Dr. Maurice Edward Vincent, superintendent of schools.

13
00:01:14,854 --> 00:01:16,455
