525
00:59:07,598 --> 00:59:20,285
[SPEAKER_14]: It is a little bit confusing because the way a BCBA would use a functional behavior assessment outside in a clinical setting is somewhat different in the sense those are only performed by behavior analysts.

526
00:59:20,685 --> 00:59:25,628
[SPEAKER_14]: Within the school, we often include school adjustment counselors, especially where there's a social-emotional need present.

527
00:59:26,866 --> 00:59:27,226
[SPEAKER_04]: Thank you.

528
00:59:27,286 --> 00:59:35,572
