544
01:01:32,520 --> 01:01:37,521
[SPEAKER_14]: I'm sorry, they'll be moving to 3.0.

545
01:01:37,921 --> 01:01:39,442
[SPEAKER_14]: Nope, 2.0.

546
01:01:39,842 --> 01:01:41,483
[SPEAKER_14]: They have a school psychologist as well.

547
01:01:43,523 --> 01:01:47,905
[SPEAKER_14]: So the Roberts, which has a 1.4 school adjustment counseling position would move to 2.0.

548
01:01:51,916 --> 01:01:58,958
[SPEAKER_14]: And then we would be looking to increase the McGlynn Middle School to two full-time school adjustment counselors.

549
01:01:58,978 --> 01:02:03,379
[SPEAKER_14]: They currently have 1.4, which is the split position with the McGlynn Elementary.

550
01:02:03,419 --> 01:02:07,301
[SPEAKER_14]: We wanna separate that so that they are responding to those buildings full-time.

