1026
01:49:33,059 --> 01:49:41,584
[SPEAKER_07]: While there will be some long-term initiatives and ongoing initiatives like extended school days, Camp Mustang and other summer programming that we will implement.

1027
01:49:41,924 --> 01:49:47,948
[SPEAKER_07]: We're also looking at ways in which we can essentially issue sub grants to areas of the organization that have

1028
01:49:48,381 --> 01:49:53,662
