01:53:00,267 --> 01:53:00,447
[SPEAKER_04]: Ms.

1048
01:53:00,467 --> 01:53:09,252
[SPEAKER_04]: Bowen, among others, and perhaps a question for the director as well, or the arts teacher instruction, music teacher instruction.

1049
01:53:10,092 --> 01:53:19,017
