1073
01:56:17,172 --> 01:56:18,132
[SPEAKER_07]: that we don't know about.

1074
01:56:18,352 --> 01:56:29,034
[SPEAKER_07]: And I think the charge to the administration and the administrators responsible for this area is to make sure that we're going through and routing out any situations in which it does occur.

1075
01:56:29,454 --> 01:56:42,476
[SPEAKER_07]: And then also, if you know that they'll come, have a program that's well-stocked enough where there's never the risk that could somehow deter someone from wanting to participate.

1076
01:56:42,536 --> 01:56:45,897
[SPEAKER_07]: So that's my high-level answer based on the story

1077
