[SPEAKER_07]: Bowen may have more specifics that she could speak to.

1080
01:56:55,518 --> 01:57:04,784
[SPEAKER_10]: Sure, I I think it we as a district need to look at our most vulnerable students in our elective courses and how we can better support them.

1081
01:57:04,804 --> 01:57:15,252
[SPEAKER_10]: And also what sort of consultation and training that we can provide to our teachers that would so every student can access music.

1082
01:57:15,312 --> 01:57:23,858
