1367
02:28:44,012 --> 02:28:45,954
[SPEAKER_13]: So it's not on the slide.

1368
02:28:46,974 --> 02:29:04,765
[SPEAKER_13]: I didn't see a column for if we included A, B and C, A, B, C and D, A, B, C, D, E. I really think that that, I mean, what was the point of all of the C, D and E's if we were not even gonna include them in a column anywhere?

1369
02:29:05,430 --> 02:29:10,853
