1423
02:34:20,868 --> 02:34:25,092
[SPEAKER_07]: And then we have a few pieces on the operational side that we need to go through.

1424
02:34:25,112 --> 02:34:28,434
[SPEAKER_07]: But beyond that, tomorrow is sort of the one opportunity

1425
02:34:28,961 --> 02:34:31,342
[SPEAKER_07]: and then also at your meeting on Monday night.

1426
02:34:32,182 --> 02:34:49,489
[SPEAKER_07]: Also, the other thing I would say in terms of the sequence, after the request is made to the municipal government and then ultimately an appropriation is made, there's still the committee has the opportunity or has a responsibility to vote to adopt the budget based on that appropriation.

1427
02:34:50,009 --> 02:34:53,310
[SPEAKER_07]: And then at that time, there's opportunity for more discussion.

1428
02:34:54,151 --> 02:34:57,132
[SPEAKER_07]: And since at that point, we have more of a sense as to what the actual

1429
02:34:58,013 --> 02:35:04,756
[SPEAKER_07]: quote unquote number is bearing in mind that we still have some ESSER operating considerations that we'll have to take into account at that point.

1430
02:35:05,617 --> 02:35:08,498
[SPEAKER_07]: That would be another opportunity to flush that out.

1431
02:35:08,518 --> 02:35:09,859
[SPEAKER_03]: Okay.

1432
02:35:09,959 --> 02:35:10,999
[SPEAKER_07]: Thank you.

1433
