[SPEAKER_02]: I just wanted to say I like this format.

1455
02:36:33,512 --> 02:36:42,614
[SPEAKER_02]: I think it's clean and concise, and it gets us quickly to the place that we need to be to be having the right discussions.

1456
02:36:44,175 --> 02:36:45,895
